nct,old<INT_MAX,new=old+1,new>0)])]]`; nested WHERE root has 3 ATM; IF root and two outcomes as RC07. READS exactly `StockPosition`. Token operators are exactly bytea `=`/`<>` after `convert_to(...,'UTF8')`; neither token arm invokes text collation. Overflow is exactly RC06.","source":{"endByte":24618,"path":"knowledge/specs/STOCK-CAJAS-C14-SIMPLIFICATION-001/RENDERING_COMPLETION_PROPOSAL.md","startByte":22944},"v2ObjectBlockSha256":"a3667f3adaf4f71cc7af89faff15956ba296349f73c4848389b7a02343645153"},"schemaVersion":"C14-SIMPLIFICATION-OBJECT-BLOCK-V2","semanticCore":{"candidateApprovalStatus":"PENDING_FRANCO_SINGLE_FINAL_APPROVAL","decisionId":"SC06","executionAuthority":false,"renderingCompletionDecisionRange":"RC01-RC12","renderingCompletionGitBlob":"d9e8aa22b2ae815326e4cafa24221d198733d87a","renderingCompletionPassObservation":5041,"renderingCompletionRawSha256":"97f586467da19b77ebf2d966acc8202f7fde1824e19f59cf19690e689f88b735","semanticCellUtf8":"| `SC06 / 05 / function:fn_stock_identified_unit_exclusivity` | `StockIdentifiedUnitOccupancy`; `GUARD`, family `ROW_OR_CROSS_ROW_GUARD`. INSERT requires version `1`, token regex `^cx04:[0-9a-f]{64}$`, and a same-company position owned by the same identified unit. UPDATE requires immutable `id/companyId/identifiedUnitId/createdAt`, valid token, and either `(position unchanged ∧ token/version unchanged)` or `(position changed ∧ token differs bytewise ∧ version=OLD.version+1 ∧ result positive/non-overflow ∧ new position has the same company/unit)`. Nothing else is inferred. | READS `StockPosition`; no evidence/command relation and no WRITES. | One IF pair and one R0001; called INSERT/UPDATE. Exact old/new/token/version and position-query locators. `CX04W,C13,DT` |","semanticSourceKind":"SC01_SC65_CANDIDATE"},"sourceSemanticSha256":"1a3e59f4c81f099378203da5e88edf1f07c535d601c99646235da13cb1b1c3c5"}
