ity":false,"renderingCompletionDecisionRange":"RC01-RC12","renderingCompletionGitBlob":"d9e8aa22b2ae815326e4cafa24221d198733d87a","renderingCompletionPassObservation":5041,"renderingCompletionRawSha256":"97f586467da19b77ebf2d966acc8202f7fde1824e19f59cf19690e689f88b735","semanticCellUtf8":"| `SC14 / 04 / check:ck_cd_origin_shape` | `cajas_difference`; exactly one complete origin arm is populated. CONTROL: `kind='CONTROL'`, `control_line_id IS NOT NULL`, and `origin_dispatch_id/origin_remito_id/dispatch_line_id/return_confirmation_id/return_line_id` are all null; its C13 FK requires `(company_id,assignment_id,control_line_id)` equality to the control line. DISPATCH: `kind='DISPATCH'`, tuple `(origin_dispatch_id,origin_remito_id,dispatch_line_id)` is wholly non-null, while `control_line_id/return_confirmation_id/return_line_id` are null; C13 requires dispatch-owner equality `(company_id,origin_dispatch_id,assignment_id,origin_remito_id)` and line equality `(company_id,origin_dispatch_id,dispatch_line_id)`. RETURN: `kind='RETURN'`, tuple `(return_confirmation_id,origin_dispatch_id,return_line_id)` is wholly non-null, while `control_line_id/origin_remito_id/dispatch_line_id` are null; C13 requires return-line equality `(company_id,return_confirmation_id,origin_dispatch_id,return_line_id)`. Partial tuples, mixed arms, a fourth kind, cross-company, cross-assignment, cross-dispatch, or mismatched remito/confirmation ownership reject. | none; native CHECK; exactly three complete arms, with every null/non-null and equality-bearing C13 FK component represented in the semantic/source inventory and tests. `J1 T09-R01..R03,C13 lines 2504–2524,ISO ISW-CX12-03/04` |","semanticSourceKind":"SC01_SC65_CANDIDATE"},"sourceSemanticSha256":"9668fe7334b137e183c4d83daba0a54ebb33216d6012588899fefed840b43546"}
