496142388ce15b47cb5d829d1de232bbfbe2c6","startByte":5576},{"endByte":6373,"kind":"IF_DECISION","lfTerminatedSha256":"006b88f779220853b3998a1ef840932c074d4b75baefcc82bac2a2df6b953358","rawSha256":"4df8713d0ed8f9c50d081636ec01d8a7bc8be8ef0a7e57cf8b7838165f97abe6","startByte":5899},{"endByte":6032,"kind":"RAISE","lfTerminatedSha256":"4d0413b5331addf46b19bf14c25263b6d72dbe282122d107b812458caf9dcaba","rawSha256":"df9ef74276ea7616b6914f078d5b821f509665e9521c4e23e7911f400fa26f4c","startByte":5944}],"rawSha256":"7b786847377c773ffb8b654cc5226128b0a103e0398b768bdcf443f488b2046f","roundTripRule":"concat(ast.losslessChildren[*].utf8Base64 decoded in ordinal order) MUST equal exact fragment bytes","semanticAstContractUtf8":"AST inventory: CTEs `currentHeader,candidateLines,ordered,scopeTotals`; one `UNION ALL`; one window `SUM(sign×quantity) OVER (PARTITION BY source_control_line_id,article_id,stock_position_id,stock_unit,scale_snapshot ORDER BY header_sequence,line_number,convert_to(id,'UTF8') ROWS UNBOUNDED PRECEDING…CURRENT ROW)`; one grouped `SUM(sign×quantity)` over the same five-key physical identity. Roots are current-header WHERE, child NOT EXISTS WHERE, candidate JOIN/WHERE, NEW-shape control/evidence JOINs, main WHERE, reversal-target WHERE, all-line coherence LEFT JOIN/WHERE, prefix-cap JOIN/WHERE, grouped-final-cap JOIN/WHERE, and IF. Missing control/evidence rows reject explicitly; SQL NULL from aggregates cannot authorize because candidateLines contains NEW, every scope is nonempty, inner cap joins must resolve, and only `v_valid IS TRUE` succeeds. Unique neutralization remains C13 `uq_cdl_neutralizes`; correction headers remain full replacement. READS exactly `cajas_dispatch,cajas_dispatch_line,cajas_control_line,StockEvidenceLine`; WRITES and in-function locks are empty. Transaction-visible reads rely on the external BIND/ISO locked-writer contract; this function issues no `FOR UPDATE`, table lock, advisory lock, or projection read.","source":{"endByte":31588,"path":"knowledge/specs/STOCK-CAJAS-C14-SIMPLIFICATION-001/RENDERING_COMPLETION_PROPOSAL.md","startByte":25200},"v2ObjectBlockSha256":"371b9b544bc02867840f5f58259ae253a5652994e855c09ee7f732cc26abca42"},"schemaVersion":"C14-SIMPLIFICATION-OBJECT-BLOCK-V2","semanticCore":{"candidateApprovalStatus":"PENDING_FRANCO_SINGLE_FINAL_APPROVAL","decisionId":"SC53","executionAuthority":false,"renderingCompletionDecisionRange":"RC01-RC12","renderingCompletionGitBlob":"d9e8aa22b2ae815326e4cafa24221d198733d87a","renderingCompletionPassObservation":5041,"renderingCompletionRawSha256":"97f586467da19b77ebf2d966acc8202f7fde1824e19f59cf19690e689f88b735","semanticCellUtf8":"| `SC53 / 31 / function:fn_cajas_dispatch_ceiling` | `cajas_dispatch_line`; resolve NEW dispatch and the unique current dispatch leaf. Validate ORIGINAL or compatible same-header REVERSAL line shape, owner/Article/unit/scale/position/evidence coherence, unique neutralization, and `netDispatch=Σ(accounting_sign×quantity)` for that current leaf. Require every lineage prefix and total nonnegative and no current-leaf quantity above its coherent accepted source-control/Stock-evidence quantity. A corrected header is full replacement and has only ORIGINAL `+1` lines. | READS `cajas_dispatch`, `cajas_dispatch_line`, `cajas_control_line`, `StockEvidenceLine`; no WRITES. `J1 rules 5/6,D5,BIND,C13,DT` |","semanticSourceKind":"SC01_SC65_CANDIDATE"},"sourceSemanticSha256":"1127244cc9d46c644d3b180b2082c3b5462c2baff0f83e626e74201ad70c537a"}
