tes its required source-only DISPATCH StockEvidenceLine has exact company/Article/from-position/quantity/unit/scale and same command semantics. Disposition caller validates required StockEvidenceLine and kind mapping: returned→destination-only RETURN with row `stock_position_id IS NULL`; consumed→source-only CONSUMPTION; missing/damaged→source-only COUNT_OBSERVATION; underReview→REVIEW_HOLD, while a matching reversal uses REVIEW_RELEASE; owner/command/quantity/unit/scale/Article all agree. | READS `StockEvidence`, `StockEvidenceLine`, `cajas_dispatch_line`, `cajas_disposition`; no WRITES. `J1 T10–T12,SFO,ISO,C13,DT` |","semanticSourceKind":"SC01_SC65_CANDIDATE"},"sourceSemanticSha256":"9942ed16ea9a7b7cd1eba269c02338a8f6c468c9cbe434a7d7f54106b0c82f98"}
